f nation personified) into his body Psa 109:18 (simile); as seat of life עַלקִֿרְבּוֺ נֶפֶשׁהַֿיּלֶד (וַ)תָּשָׁב 1Kin 17:21-22 , compare (of idol) Hab 2:19 (see also 2 ). b. = belly, of kine ׳אֶלקֿ Gen 41:21 ; 14:21 c. of city ( ׳בְּק within it, ׳מִקּ etc.) Gen 18:24 ; Judg 18:7 ; Amos 3:9 + 18:t compare Isa 25:11 ׳בְּק חוּצוֺת 5:25 . d of house Psa 101:2 ; 101:7 ; temple 48:10 ; ׳בְּק דֶ֑ךָ מוֺעֲ 74:4 . e. of land (earth) Gen 45:6 ; 48:16 ; Amos 2:3 ; Isa 5:8 ; 24:13 (|| הָעַמִּים בְּתוֺח ), + 10 t. ( ׳מִקּ ׳בְּק ). f. of a number of person , ׳כְּק in the midst, among , ׳מִקּ from among : especially (1) people (96 t.; 80 t. as singular collective, 15 t. plural Amos 7:8 ; Gen 24:3 ; Exod 23:25 ; Deut 31:17 ; Jer 46:21 ; 1Sam 4:3 ; Josh 7:12 ; Judg 10:16 +, ׳בְּק ׳יִשׂ Deut 17:10 +, יִשׂ ׳בֵּית ׳בְּק Amos 7:10 ׳בְּק הַכְּנַעֲנִי Judg 1:32-33 , 3:5 , ׳מִקּ גּוֺי Deut 4:34 etc (2) ׳בְּק הַמַּחֲנֶה׳(מִק ) Josh 1:11 ; Num 14:44 6 t. (3) ׳בְּק אֶחָיו Deut 18:2 ; 1Sam 16:13 , and ( ׳מִק ) Deut 17:15 ; 18:18 . (4) ׳מִקּ עַמֶּיהָ Exod 31:14 (II. עַם ) (5) ׳בְּק אֹיְכֶיךָ Psa 110:2 compare (of wicked) 55:16 ׳בְּק חֲכָמִים Prov 15:31 . (6) ׳בְּק יִשְׁמֹּט אֱלֹהִים Psa 82:1 -7 ׳בְּק הַמִּלְחָמָה 1Kin 20:39 into the midst of the battle , the thick of the fight; ׳בְּק צָרָה Palam 1Ki 138:7. (8) of nations, ׳בְּק הַגּוֺיִם Deut 29:15 , הָעַמִּים Lam 3:45 , compare Josh 24:17 ; Micah 5:6 ; 5:7 . g. ׳מִקּ חוקך Psa 74:11 (Qr חֵיקְךָ ) thy hand from within thy bosom , (anthropomorphism of ׳י ; see I כלה Pi`el 2 c ). h. of a period of time , ׳בְּק שָׁנִים Hab 3:2 (twice in verse) 2 of inward part of man ; a. as seat of thought and emotion : ׳בְּק 1Kin 3:28 ; Jer 4:14 ; 9:7 ; Prov 26:24 ; Psa 62:5 ; 94:19 ; || בְלֵב Prov 14:33 , עַללֵֿב Jer 31:33 ; seat of לֵב Psa 39:4 ; 55:5 ; 109:22 ; Lam 1:20 ; of רוּחַ Ezek 11:19 ; 36:26-27 , Zech 12:1 ; Isa 26:6 ; Psa 51:12 , compare Isa 19:3 , 14 ; ׳בְּק לִבִּי Psa 36:2 (read לִבּוֺ Vrss Hup Now Che Bae and others) b. as faculty of thought and emotion, sujb. (no perp.) Isa 16:11 (|| מֵעַי ) Psa 64:7 (|| לֵב ) 5:10 ; כָּלקְֿרָבַי 103:1 (only here plural; || נַפְשִׁי ); — 49:12 read ᵑ7 ᵑ6 ᵐ5 קִבְרָם , or קְבָרִם , Ew Gr Ol Bi Che Bae and others (for קִרְבָּם ) 3 technical term in P of entrails of sacrificial animals (Di Lev 1:9 , 13 ; 3:3 (twice in verse); 3:9 (twice in verse); 3:14 (twice in verse); 4:8 (twice in verse); 4:11 ; 7:3 ; 8:16 , 21 , 25 ; 9:14 .","rootNote":"from 7126 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Kgs 3 28","keyReferences":["1Kgs 3 28","1Kgs 17 21","1Kgs 17 22","1Kgs 20 39","1Sam 4 3","1Sam 16 13","1Sam 25 37","Amos 2 3"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":227,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Kgs 3 28","book":"1Kgs","chapter":3,"verse":28,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/קִרְבּ֖/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 17 21","book":"1Kgs","chapter":17,"verse":21,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קִרְבּֽ/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 17 22","book":"1Kgs","chapter":17,"verse":22,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"קִרְבּ֖/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"1Kgs 20 39","book":"1Kgs","chapter":20,"verse":39,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְ/קֶֽרֶב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"1Sam 4 3","book":"1Sam","chapter":4,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְ/קִרְבֵּ֔/נוּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc/Sp1cp"},{"reference":"1Sam 16 13","book":"1Sam","chapter":16,"verse":13,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/קֶ֣רֶב","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc"},{"reference":"1Sam 25 37","book":"1Sam","chapter":25,"verse":37,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"בְּ/קִרְבּ֔/וֹ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Amos 2 3","book":"Amos","chapter":2,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"מִ/קִּרְבָּ֑/הּ","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmsc/Sp3fs"},{"reference":"Amos 3 9","book":"Amos"